  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/660/660-34.htm",
  "statuteText": "660:34 Equipment and Technical Assistance. –\n\nThe secretary of state shall develop policies, procure the equipment, and arrange for any required technical assistance to support the audit process of ballot counting devices used in state elections in accordance with RSA 660:35."
